From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:20:01 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 163/297] Meridian: no crash where Chromium reaches for a
 toolbar or BrowserView the WebUI window hasn't got
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Save address (the window had no autofill bubble handler; the window lookup
by tab found no BrowserView), the iOS promo, send tab to self, storage
pressure, relaunch, sharing, ⌘W on a strip-pinned tab, downloads deep scan,
web app focus, sign-in interception, batch upload, accessibility announce.
Autofill bubbles and the others sit where page info would, as the password
bubble does (bubble_anchor_util::GetToolbarOrPageInfoAnchor).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
